{"p":{"n":"Marhalah Rosulullah      Khatamun Nabiyyin Learning Hub","t":"Kajian, Pemikiran & Khazanah Keilmuan","d":"Ruang dokumentasi karya tulis ilmiah: makalah, jurnal, tafsir, dan kajian dalam satu arsip yang rapi.","ay":"مَا كَانَ مُحَمَّدٌ أَبَا أَحَدٍ مِّن رِّجَالِكُمْ وَلَٰكِن رَّسُولَ اللَّهِ وَخَاتَمَ النَّبِيِّينَ ۗ وَكَانَ اللَّهُ بِكُلِّ شَيْءٍ عَلِيمًا","ph":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"c":[{"i":"📖","n":"Al-Qur'an & Tafsir"},{"i":"⚖️","n":"Fiqih & Ushul Fiqih"},{"i":"🕌","n":"Teologi"},{"i":"🏛️","n":"Filsafat"},{"i":"✨","n":"Irfan"},{"i":"🤲","n":"Akhlak"},{"i":"📜","n":"Sejarah"},{"i":"📚","n":"Nahjul Bala"}],"a":[{"id":1,"t":"Contoh Makalah: Pengantar Ushul Fiqih","c":"Fiqih & Ushul Fiqih","k":"Makalah","d":"2026-10-05","s":"Ini hanya contoh tulisan. Admin dapat mengedit atau menghapusnya.","b":"## Pendahuluan\nIni paragraf contoh. Ganti dengan isi makalah Anda.\n\n## Pembahasan\nPisahkan paragraf dengan satu baris kosong."},{"id":2,"t":"Contoh Kajian: Renungan Mingguan","c":"Refleksi","k":"Kajian","d":"2026-10-03","s":"Contoh kajian singkat untuk melihat tampilan kartu dan halaman baca.","b":"Isi kajian contoh.\n\nTambahkan tulisan baru lewat tombol ＋ Tulisan pada mode admin."},{"id":1791248939765,"d":"2026-10-06","t":"Ayat At-Tathir","c":"Al-Qur'an & Tafsir","k":"Makalah","s":"Surat Al-Ahzab 33","b":"jahefou hwserucgfiw4nsgaug  tqyfctf78tqw9oyf a\nyfe9wuya 79tyf3r\n uyf 3qyuxb hqd"}]}